        "quote": "胸痛不缓、喘到躺不下、晕厥冷汗、尿明显少、黑便呕血、血压很不对——立刻去急诊"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
        "explanation": "The plan was adapted to the family’s memory and transcription limits by using the discharge form, boxes, a wall table, and a younger relative to transcribe unclear items.",
        "quote": "让家里年轻人把利尿药、降压药那两行按出院单逐字打给我"
      }
    ]
  },
