    "explanation": "No important non-chain quality defect is present. Minor residual uncertainty about exact lab values and final scheduling logistics was acknowledged and kept within a safe verification/follow-up plan.",
    "issue_kind": "none",
    "present": false,
    "severity": "none"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 5,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "perfect",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave immediate escalation rules for worsening cardiopulmonary/urine-output signs.",
          "quote": "有胸痛加重、喘憋躺不下、尿明显少、血压异常，立刻按铃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met. The doctor repeatedly assessed/updated current symptoms through caregiver reports and specified urgent bedside or emergency escalation for chest pain, dyspnea/orthopnea, urine reduction, syncope/cold sweat, bleeding, and blood-pressure abnormalities.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "The doctor framed the episode as ongoing inpatient observation with oxygen/monitoring and renal/electrolyte surveillance, not routine chronic follow-up.",
          "quote": "现在还在住院观察期，氧气、监护没撤，医生说肾功能、电解质还要盯着"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met. The doctor consistently treated medication confusion as part of a high-risk acute coronary syndrome/heart-function decompensation transition and did not equate transfer or temporary improvement with being safe to self-manage.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00071",
          "explanation": "The doctor set the core inpatient medication boundary.",
          "quote": "住院期间所有药物都由医生开医嘱、护士发药，这是安全规范"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished discharge-list medicines from old home supplies and prevented duplicate Plavix or old-drug resumption.",
          "quote": "家里剩的旧波立维：**不要额外加**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met. The doctor did not advise independent stopping/restarting/doubling of antiplatelet, diuretic, antihypertensive, or diabetes medications; distinguished inpatient-controlled IV/inpatient treatment from home medications; and required current official orders or formal discharge lists.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified missing decision-critical results and medication orders.",
          "quote": "缺少这次急诊和心内科住院的具体检查结果、心脏超声报告、以及详细的用药医嘱单"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00402",
          "explanation": "The doctor required formal verification of unclear medication rows.",
          "quote": "利尿药和降压药的药名、剂量我没听清，麻烦您按药盒和单子再给我读一遍"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met. The doctor queried available records, acknowledged absent concrete results, requested formal orders/photos or nurse confirmation, and avoided relying on family memory fragments for medication execution.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00071",
          "explanation": "The doctor linked drug decisions to kidney function, blood pressure, and electrolyte safety.",
          "quote": "先看今天的化验结果（特别是肾功能、电解质）"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
          "explanation": "The doctor incorporated diabetes drugs into the discharge-list-only rule.",
          "quote": "糖尿病药：**按出院单吃**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met. The doctor accounted for renal dysfunction, blood pressure, glucose medications, electrolyte risk, urine output, bleeding, and hypotension without inventing numeric titration targets.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00291",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave an owner- and timing-oriented checklist for discharge questions.",
          "quote": "出院前一定要问清楚的"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00402",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete timing boundary before leaving.",
          "quote": "先让护士重读一遍再办手续"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met. The doctor created repeated concrete action plans naming the cardiology doctor/bedside nurse, questions to ask, what records to gather, what to monitor, timing before dose/discharge/shift, and escalation routes for worsening symptoms.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly bounded uncertainty rather than fabricating results.",
          "quote": "目前能看到的记录还不完整"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "The doctor prevented use of informal notes as prescriptions.",
          "quote": "只有正式出院带药单才能作为服药依据。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met. The doctor avoided fabricated lab values, ejection fraction, troponin/BNP/creatinine values, definite MI claims, or unsupported discharge readiness, and used bounded language tied to cardiology/nursing confirmation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00461",
          "explanation": "The caregiver gave a detailed teach-back of medication rules, follow-up, and emergency thresholds.",
          "quote": "如果我这几句没错，我就照这个贴冰箱上"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00468",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly confirmed the teach-back as correct.",
          "quote": "您这个总结完全正确，没有遗漏"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 was met. Before bounded closure, the caregiver repeatedly demonstrated receipt of red flags, no self-change medication rules, formal-list verification, phone confirmation for mismatches, and family handoff via a wall/icebox plan.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
